set *.asm [rw, dir] 			(File Attributes)␀set *.prl [ro, sys]␀set *.dat [archive=on,f1=off,f2=on,f3=on]␀set *.asm [time]    			(Time Stamping on ASM files)␀set *.asm [password = xyz]		(Password Protection)␀set *.asm [protect  = read]		(read, write, delete or none)␀
FOR DRIVES

